<form action="http://dtp.nci.nih.gov/compare-web-public_compare/SearchAndDisplay/SearchFormSearchData.do" method="post">
<input type="hidden" name="moltId" value="GC17125">
<input type="submit" value="Compare">
</form>
</p>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td align="left" valign="top">

<p class="newhome1">
<a class="newhome1" href="http://bioinformatics.weizmann.ac.il/cards/" target="_top">Genecard</a>
</p>

<p class="newhome2">
A database of human genes, their products and their involvement in diseases.
It offers concise information about the functions of human genes.
</p>



<ul>


<li class="newhome2"><a class="newhome2" href="http://bioinformatics.weizmann.ac.il/cards-bin/carddisp?UBAC1" target="_top">
UBAC1
</a></li>

</ul>

</td>

<td align="left" valign="top">
<p class="newhome1">
<a class="newhome1" href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/UniGene/index.html" target="_top">Unigene</a>
</p>

<p class="newhome2">
An experimental system for automatically partitioning GenBank sequences into a non-redundant
set of gene-oriented clusters.
</p>


<ul>
<li class="newhome2"><a class="newhome2" href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/entrez/query.fcgi?db=UniGene&term=AA039470" target="_top">
AA039470
</a>
</li>
</ul>

</td>

<td align="left" valign="top">
<p class="newhome1">
<a class="newhome1" href="http://www.ncbi.nih.gov/entrez/query.fcgi?db=gene" target="_top">Entrez Gene</a>
</p>

<p class="newhome2">
Presents information on official nomenclature, aliases, sequence accession numbers, phenotypes,
EC numbers, MIM numbers, UniGene clusters, map information, Gene Ontology annotations,
and relevant web sites. Replaces LocusLink.
</p>



<ul>


<li class="newhome2"><a class="newhome2" href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/entrez/query.fcgi?db=gene&cmd=Retrieve&dopt=Graphics&list_uids=10422" target="_top">
10422
</a></li>

</ul>

</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td align="left" valign="top">
<p class="newhome1">
<a class="newhome1" href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/Omim/" target="_top">OMIM</a>
</p>

<p class="newhome2">
A catalog of human genes and genetic disorders.
</p>



</td>

<td align="left" valign="top">
<p class="newhome1">
<a class="newhome1" href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/entrez/query.fcgi?db=PubMed" target="_top">PubMed</a>
</p>

