UBAC1
</a>
</li>

</ul>

</td>

<td align="left" valign="top">
<p class="newhome1">
<a class="newhome1" href="http://cgap.nci.nih.gov/" target="_top">CGAP</a>
</p>

<p class="newhome2">
CGAP provides information on gene expression, SNPs, functional pathways and
more in normal, precancerous and cancer cells.
</p>


<ul>


<li class="newhome2"><a class="newhome2" href="http://cgap.nci.nih.gov/Genes/RunUniGeneQuery?PAGE=1&ORG=Hs&SYM=&PATH=++&TERM=UBAC1">
UBAC1
</a>
</li>

</ul>


